&lt;/xref&gt; (epo:Document) External concept defined by &lt;xref scope="external" href="https://www.dublincore.org/specifications/dublin-core/dcmi-terms/#http://purl.org/dc/terms/description"&gt;&lt;foreign otherprops="#0000ff"&gt;&lt;u&gt;https://www.dublincore.org/specifications/dublin-core/dcmi-terms/#http://purl.org/dc/terms/description&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/foreign&gt;&lt;/xref&gt; (epo:ElectronicSignature) External concept defined by &lt;xref scope="external" href="https://www.dublincore.org/specifications/dublin-core/dcmi-terms/#http://purl.org/dc/terms/description"&gt;&lt;foreign otherprops="#0000ff"&gt;&lt;u&gt;https://www.dublincore.org/specifications/dublin-core/dcmi-terms/#http://purl.org/dc/terms/description&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/foreign&gt;&lt;/xref&gt; (epo:Fund)</skos:definition>
