    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The Energy efficiency item table is a controlled vocabulary that lists the products, works and services covered by any of the following: - The Ecodesign Directive - European Union green public procurement criteria - Regulation 2020/740 - Buildings covered by the obligation in Article 7 EED</skos:definition>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">energy-efficiency-item</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
